     CZ/I charges split the PHE CZ+HZ total (+0.0225) so the residue stays neutral (CZ +0.0825, I -0.0600).
     C-I bond 2.10 A, C-C-I angle 120 deg, iodine vdW Rmin/2 2.35 A, eps 0.40 kcal/mol (GAFF-like).
     No sigma-hole (no extra point): fine for model building, not for halogen-bond energetics. -->
